  <p><strong>Coordinate convention:</strong> inches, +X east, +Y north, +Z up;1in=2.54cm. X origin is the interpreted wall END; Y origin is the exposed finished reference edge. The perpendicular5.50in and along-plank8.75in references are different quantities.</p>
