  <p>ORIGINAL R05 end-chain (not advanced-front differences): F0\u2192F1=16.0625in; F1\u2192F2=13.25in; F2\u2192F3=11.3125in. Their sum40.625in is a relative end-chain check, not proof of every adjacent future joint. The local cold-hall faces are conditionally x=57.875 and91.625in. Neither width is extended through every hall bend.</p>
